        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_63db3aacf4db4a607896",
          "document_start": 538,
          "document_end": 604,
          "text": "用拉格朗日方程法建立的多刚体系统的动力学模型是混合的微分-代数方程组(DAE)，其特点是方程组数目相当大，而且微分方程常常是刚性的。",
          "section_id": "section_d75be77411d1",
          "start": 538,
          "end": 604,
          "chunk_start": 538,
          "chunk_end": 604,
          "sentence_document_start": 538,
          "sentence_document_end": 604,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_32b45bd8bc587edb32c0",
          "document_start": 604,
          "document_end": 638,
          "text": "求微分-代数方程组的数值解算法研究是多刚体系统动力学的一个重要问题。",
          "section_id": "section_d75be77411d1",
          "start": 604,
          "end": 638,
          "chunk_start": 604,
          "chunk_end": 638,
          "sentence_document_start": 604,
          "sentence_document_end": 638,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_359d8740b992d78e230f",
          "document_start": 640,
          "document_end": 660,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
          "section_id": "section_d75be77411d1",
          "start": 640,
          "end": 660,
          "chunk_start": 640,
          "chunk_end": 660,
          "sentence_document_start": 640,
          "sentence_document_end": 660,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
